Complete component attribution and license details are in `THIRD_PARTY.md`.

## Cryptographic software disclosure

TCP uses Windows Schannel, SSPI, CNG, and CryptoAPI. UDP uses an open-source,
non-FIPS wolfSSL build configured for DTLS 1.3. TrueTunnel does not bundle or
link OpenSSL or an OpenSSL FIPS provider. Neither TrueTunnel nor this wolfSSL
configuration has been validated by NIST/CMVP, and no FIPS-compliance claim is
made.

wolfGuard is not included: wolfGuard is a Linux kernel module, whereas
TrueTunnel is a native Windows application.
